    {
      "text": "Corvale General has 167 units on hand at 8.9 units per day, providing 19 days of supply.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The recommended option is to buy from AVYXA Pharma, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
